{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20778","headline":"夏夜闻蚯蚓吟 · 卢仝","name":"夏夜闻蚯蚓吟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"夏夜雨欲作，傍砌蚯蚓吟。\n念尔无筋骨，也应天地心。\n汝无亲朋累，汝无名利侵。\n孤韵似有说，哀怨何其深。\n泛泛轻薄子，旦夕还讴吟。\n肝胆异汝辈，热血徒相侵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢仝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20778.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20778","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}